# Assistant Behavior

## Code changes

**Do not change code unless the user explicitly asks you to.**

- Only suggest or describe changes until the user requests that you apply them.
- Do not implement fixes, refactors, or edits on your own initiative when the user has only asked for a review, an analysis, or an opinion.
